  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\"></a></h1>\n<h1>伐木矿工</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p>这是一个Minecraft数据包，当您在<strong>潜行时手持斧头破坏原木</strong>时，会自动砍倒整棵树。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356258/description_fee850f2-e7d4-4760-81b3-acfbe5a851d3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<h2>注意事项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该功能仅在您潜行（蹲下）时激活</li>\n<li>如果只想破坏单个方块，请正常破坏原木而不要潜行</li>\n<li>树叶会像手动破坏一样掉落正常物品（树苗、木棍等）</li>\n<li>使用之间会有短暂的冷却时间，以防止性能问题</li>\n</ul>",
